vWii filesystem access uses the established IOSUHAX/FSA access model from:
- Compat Title Installer, Xpl0itU and contributors, GPL-2.0-or-later
  https://github.com/Xpl0itU/compat-installer
- wuphax, FIX94 and contributors, MIT
  https://github.com/FIX94/wuphax

libiosuhax is an external dependency by Dimok and contributors under its
zlib-style license. WUT and libmocha are external dependencies under their
respective licenses.

No ticket, TMD, title, IOS, NAND, or channel write/install/delete code is used
by the GameVault read-only diagnostic scanner.
